></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong> </strong></i></u>Till, Plant, Water and Harvest crops and flowers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chop trees and collect wood for building and crafting.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Mounts and cart for transporting materials and Lodgers to their lodge.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish a wide variety of fish. Bake fresh bread from your harvested wheat and mill-ground flour. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build Lodges and advertise and rent-out to Lodgers. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine ores and craft furniture and smelt weaponry. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off any wolves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your lodges with furniture pre-bought and crafted. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook for lodgers at Capstone hall from a variety of recipes. Either to orders or just hand out wherever you go.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lodgers will rate their stay and leave messages and star ratings in the Town hall guestbook. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quests from the games characters. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lodgers participate in holiday activities such as fishing, exploring the mountains, hosting BBQ's or Water skiing. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Canoes and speedboats help you get around quickly or take a Skycar up into the mountains. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autosave enabled (configurable) - no need to sleep and rest-up energy. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon woodland creatures to help you cut trees, harvest crops and fast travel across the world map.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Throneroom Interactive LTD"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamst